:"File browser designed for elementary OS","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttps://elementary.io\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"201","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FOCe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f221397-9689-4912-9a09-8ecab938b369","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"thunarをいつも使ってるんですが、深い階層まで潜るときにちょっと面倒で。。","ts":"1624442319.099200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cv4BU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ca79291-8bff-4b69-9ee4-918353422eb5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえばGUIのファイラー全く知らないな","ts":"1624442266.099000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UXWgx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f763dcc8-1060-4802-b7ba-0281afef0220","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttp://malkalech.com/ranger_filer\u003e\nこれですかね。たしかにイメージはこんな感じです!\nただ、CUIのファイラ枠はdiredがあるので、GUIのファイラが欲しいです。。","ts":"1624442202.098800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Jenemal Notes: CLI で Linux ファイルマネージャ ranger を使うことのメモ","id":1,"title":"CLI で Linux ファイルマネージャ ranger を使うことのメモ","title_link":"http://malkalech.com/ranger_filer","text":"CLIで使うファイルマネージャ「ranger」はシンプルでカスタマイザブルなLinux/Unix向けTUIツール。vimライクなキーバインドに独特の1画面3列構成だが、2画面ファイラーとしても使える。また、画像、動画、pdf、書庫などのプレビューもでき、独自のファイルランチャー「rifle」を備える。","thumb_url":"http://malkalech.com/wp/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/ranger_filer_ss_preview_image.png","blocks":null,"ts":1482797580,"service_name":"Jenemal Notes","thumb_width":1024,"thumb_height":748,"from_url":"http://malkalech.com/ranger_filer","original_url":"http://malkalech.com/ranger_filer"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y9Upy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0aa4aaaf-00e2-40ab-8c5d-dcd292af6cd3","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"cuiでよければ、ranger系かな","ts":"1624442053.098600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lpiSF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04500cc3-ccce-44c1-b6a9-a11409e28691","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/img/01.png\u003e","ts":"1624442025.098000","attachments":[{"fallback":"860x487px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/img/01.png","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/img/01.png","original_url":"https://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/img/01.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dwic"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12035bc2-5beb-4767-85eb-e8309f7d66b9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"MacのFinderが結構好きだったんですが、似たソフトってlinuxにありますでしょうか？\n\u003chttps://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/\u003e\nこんな感じに1カラムが1つの階層で、右に向かってどんどん深い階層が見れるようなソフトです。","ts":"1624442010.097700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Webデザインラボ: 【Mac】Finderにフォルダのフルパスを表示させる方法","id":1,"title":"【Mac】Finderにフォルダのフルパスを表示させる方法","title_link":"https://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/","text":"Last updated on 2017/06/12 こんにちは（・∀・） MacでFinderを開いている時、開いている現在位置を知りたくなることはよくあることだと思います。今日は開いているフォルダ","thumb_url":"https://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/mac.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Webデザインラボ","service_icon":"https://www.webdlab.com/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":1000,"thumb_height":563,"from_url":"https://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/","original_url":"https://www.webdlab.com/mac/tips-finder-2/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sljcX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba49aee9-92f6-438c-b713-dea39bcd00e0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"rclone知らなかったです。試してみます。","ts":"1624439909.097400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0AdUq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dd4b2ea-5b1e-47f0-8fe8-20512eb36edf","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"その辺の話題は rclone が先端行ってるので rclone になければほぼ無理という話でもある。","ts":"1624438536.097200","thread_ts":"1624438536.097200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U03C6TEAZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O6zh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"545d592f-cfbf-406d-afbb-bf3eb6158a48","type":"message","user":"U01K7AWE26N","text":"rclone mount ですべてが解決しました。ありがとうございます。","ts":"1624457510.109000","thread_ts":"1624438536.097200","parent_user_id":"U03C6TEAZ","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wXA4y"}]}]
